{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"text\": \"难堪没让他少喜欢，可再多给一点，也证明不了自己什么都不求。\",\n      \"key\": \"多给一点\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他专注此刻的关切，照常关心对方、真心盼对方过得好，也承认自己仍盼被珍惜。\",\n      \"key\": \"专注此刻的关切\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"text\": \"忙着关心对方时，他暂时顾不上猜对方是否在意，静下来，那念头又会回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"念头又会回来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他独自回味时，留在心里的甜是真的，可想被珍惜的心事终究只能自己体会，甜里也有一点酸楚。\",\n      \"key\": \"留在心里的甜\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R24\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留难堪没有减轻喜欢、靠多给不能证明无所求这两点，把抽象的“解不开矛盾”改成他能想到的具体限度。S05-2提供自我怀疑的前因，S05-3则限制了他把过去的关心全盘看成有所图的可能。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R25\", \"R26\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补回期待\",\n      \"why\": \"合并反复检查与把心思放回当下关心的重复意思，保留照常关心对方、真心盼对方过得好的事实，并明说他仍盼被珍惜，不必先压掉期待才能真心关心。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R25\", \"R27\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把回应念头暂时退开、安静后又回来的变化写清，解释B2中反复出现的心事。轻松只是暂时的，想被珍惜的心思并没有消失。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R27\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留独自珍藏的甜及其个人体验，去掉可以脱离人物经历而成立的泛泛句式，补出独自回味时甜意为何夹着酸楚，以回应B3，同时不把它写成感情已经得到解决。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"B4将主体验理解为更贴身的感官沉醉，与B1清澈、朴素的主体验不能同时成立。按要求不强行把另一种听法补成他的心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "29d90a79-6584-4070-8435-3bb8ab649d54", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T131729828820Z", "elapsed_seconds": 775.812, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T13:30:25.662239+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "afd0e1d53686125828122cadddecdbfc6f510c406b25b4d4ba495c9c3c78bd4d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T131729828820Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"]